{"rowNumber":10744,"id":"01姉_04_03h.ks#1530","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I then let myself go and completely place my weight on top of her.","korean":"그리고 완전히 몸을 맡기고, 무게를 그녀에게 둔다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"translated","voice":"","phaseId":"H23-P7"},
{"rowNumber":10745,"id":"01姉_04_03h.ks#1533","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"All I can feel now is the softness of her body, and her sweet scent.","korean":"지금 느껴지는 건 그녀의 부드러운 몸과 온기뿐이다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"translated","voice":"","phaseId":"H23-P7"},
{"rowNumber":10746,"id":"01姉_04_03h.ks#1537","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Hehehe... hehe...\"","korean":"\"흐음... 흐음...\"","recordingScript":"\"흐음... 흐음...\"","memo":"translated","voice":"✓","phaseId":"H23-P7"},
{"rowNumber":10747,"id":"01姉_04_03h.ks#1540","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"We look at each other in the eyes, and she pets my head.","korean":"서로 눈을 마주보고, 그녀가 내 머리를 쓰다듬는다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"translated","voice":"","phaseId":"H23-P7"},
{"rowNumber":10748,"id":"01姉_04_03h.ks#1544","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Just as she does, I forget all about last year, all about feeling terribly alone. It's all in the past now.","korean":"그녀가 그렇게 하자, 지난 해의 모든 걸 잊게 된다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"translated","voice":"","phaseId":"H23-P7"}
